## Lore

The males are the shamans, healers and spiritual leaders of the Staphra, all natural Mystics. Their homeworld was poor in magic, so they leaned on psychic power; only under the Splugorth have they learned to master magic and the supernatural. They are the race''s educators and caretakers of the young, run the tribe''s domestic and social life, make and enforce its laws and give it spiritual guidance. Psionically they are slightly stronger than the traditional Mystic, in part as compensation for a slightly weaker body.

## Body

6 feet to 6 feet 6 inches (1.8 to 1.95 m) tall, 120 to 160 lbs (54 to 72 kg). Average life span 80 years.

## GM Notes

Habitat: wherever the Splugorth are. Slave Market Value: 700,000 to 1.2 million credits, for their healing and magic. Allies: generally as the Warrior, but the male Mystics are less respected than the female warriors and may be held back from becoming official Minions for a few years after the women are accepted. Enemies: every enemy of the Splugorth.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'staphra-mystic');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'staphra-mystic';

